WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:04.000
Londor, they call it the Hollow Realm

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.460
and it has links to a primordial serpent,

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.140
to New Londo,

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.620
to Velka, the Goddess of Sin,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.660
and to the most intriguing, hard to get ending of Dark Souls 3.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:21.220
It's a hugely significant location from a lore point of view,

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.780
and I'm confident that this is where the DLC will be based.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.600
"Make Londor whole..."

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:34.140
Let me paint a picture of Londor for you.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:40.280
Londor is a society of undead, comprised
of corpses and shades who have led

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.930
unsavory lives. As such,

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:48.930
these hollows are deeply detested, and
hated, which is nothing new for hollow-kind, really.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:54.300
It's even been recorded that sometimes a
hollow will use a purging stone to

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:58.590
remove the physical effects of the
undead curse, temporarily reversing their

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:03.989
hollowing. And occasionally a hollow will
even fool himself into thinking he's no

00:01:03.989 --> 00:01:07.380
longer cursed, and will turn on his own
kind.

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.799
Which reminds me of what Hodrik says down here.

00:01:10.799 --> 00:01:16.320
"This pit is for hollows, not for the
likes of you sane folk. Or perhaps

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:18.450
you are a hollow

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.380
posing as otherwise?"

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:25.719
And I tell you these things because even
though the hollows of Londor

00:01:25.719 --> 00:01:30.789
are hated, even though they sometimes fight amongst themselves, they still remain a

00:01:30.789 --> 00:01:36.759
truly unique example of hollows forming
a society, and that is interesting

00:01:36.759 --> 00:01:39.850
because undead are a powerful force if
they have a purpose.

00:01:40.539 --> 00:01:44.500
We see that in the Undead Legion who
fought the abyss, and we see that in

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.289
every protagonist from a Dark Souls game

00:01:47.289 --> 00:01:54.000
really. So it begs the question, what are
the undying hollows of Londor fighting for?

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.020
And what are they bound by?

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:02.620
"The Age of Fire was founded by the old gods, sustained by the linking of the fire.

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:08.440
But the gods are no more, and the all-powerful fire deserveth a new heir.

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:13.100
Our Lord of Hollows it shall be,

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:16.820
who weareth the true face of mankind."

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:24.180
This is Yuria, seeker of the Lord of
Hollows, and one of the three maidens who

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:29.890
founded The Sable Church of Londor.
The Sable Church translates to "The Black

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:33.430
Church", and it's towers are said to
resemble the eight

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:39.790
jagged branches of the Morian Blade. The
church is said to offer salvation to

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:44.780
hollows, which must be a pretty
attractive tagline for cursed individuals.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:50.200
I'd wager that if I was cursed with
undeath, then I'd be pretty open to a

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:55.090
little bit of faith to keep me from
hollowing. So it's very clearly implied

00:02:55.090 --> 00:03:00.700
that the Sable Church is what keeps the
hollows of Londor grounded. This faith

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.950
is not an oath taken lightly

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:07.959
however, because those who fuck up are
exiled and they're given the words to

00:03:07.959 --> 00:03:13.989
the Atonement miracle. Hollows who recite
this miracle think that they're reciting

00:03:13.989 --> 00:03:19.720
words of forgiveness, but in reality the
Atonement miracle makes you attract more

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.580
attention from foes and

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:26.590
increases enemy agro range. That's a
pretty evil punishment!

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:31.000
Not only are you exiled, you're exiled and you
have death following you everywhere.

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:36.520
The three maidens who founded the Sable
Church, they cut an imposing figure.

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:42.550
All three are highly skilled fences. So
skilled in fact, that they were able to

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:45.970
found the Sable Church between just the
three of them.

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:51.340
The third eldest daughter is named
Lillian, a woman who seems to have

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:54.730
contributed a lot of the theology behind
the church.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:04:00.370
She was the first to speak the words of
the Londor Braille Divine Tome, and is

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:06.010
also set to recount tales that portray
the suffering and conflict of hollows.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:09.010
Lillian is not featured in game,

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:15.610
not yet anyway. The second eldest is Yuria,
and if Lillian was the speaker than Yuria

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:20.950
would be the swordswoman, as she is said
to have claimed a hundred lives with her

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:26.470
weapon Dark Drift, this legendary cursed
sword with an unseen blade that

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:29.230
penetrates straight through shields.

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:36.160
Nothing can defend from Dark Drift. And
the eldest? The firstborn daughter? She's

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:40.900
not been named, but we know that she
exists because these three daughters

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:46.390
founded the church, and the only others
in this equation that go without names..

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:50.680
Well, they're the mother and the father
of the three daughters and surely these

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.330
parents are important

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:56.919
right? Because why else would there be
three founders that are referenced as

00:04:56.919 --> 00:05:00.700
"daughters", with mentions to their order
of birth?

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:04.060
So the only reason I can think of that
they would do this is that the parents

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:09.190
are important, and I think I know who the
mother might be, but that speculation

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:13.540
will wait till the end of the video. At
any rate these three daughters are

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:19.479
described as maidens of a primordial
serpent, and when we murder Yuria we

00:05:19.479 --> 00:05:22.580
figure out who this serpent is.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:27.740
"Kaathe, I have failed thee..."

00:05:27.979 --> 00:05:32.319
"Greetings undead warrior.

00:05:32.509 --> 00:05:37.329
I am the primordial serpent, Darkstalker
Kaathe.

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:41.870
I can guide thee, and illuminate the
truth.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:51.349
Your ancestor claimed the Dark Soul and
waited for fire to subside, and soon the

00:05:51.349 --> 00:05:59.289
flames did fade, and only dark remained.
Thus began the age of men.

00:05:59.629 --> 00:06:07.490
The age of dark. However, Lord Gwyn
trembled at the dark, clinging to his age

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:15.080
of fire and in dire fear of humans, and
the Dark Lord who would one day be born

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.310
amongst them,

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:19.830
Lord Gwyn resisted the course of nature

00:06:19.969 --> 00:06:26.419
by sacrificing himself to link the fire
and commanding his children to shepherd

00:06:26.419 --> 00:06:35.569
the humans. Gwyn has blurred your past to
prevent the birth of the dark lord. I am

00:06:35.569 --> 00:06:37.940
the primordial serpent.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:44.620
I see to right the wrongs of the past. To
discover our true law."

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:50.240
The primordial serpent of Dark Souls one,
who corrupted the four kings, who

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:56.360
polluted the kingdom of Oolacile with the
abyss, is back. And now through Yuria,

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:58.909
through the Sable Church of Londor,

00:06:58.909 --> 00:07:03.809
the pilgrims, Yoel, Kaathe continues to seek a
ruler of men.

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:17.020
"They failed me. Every last one of them. They were strong, but saw not the truth. I am certain that you will prove different."

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:22.759
Kaathe and the Sable Church are watching events in Lothric very closely, because the world is on the

00:07:22.759 --> 00:07:27.740
precipice of the linking of the fire. And
the Sable Church are determined to

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:29.599
influence that event.

00:07:29.599 --> 00:07:34.819
Hundreds of Londor Pilgrims are sent
towards the highest towers of Lothric Castle.

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:38.780
So many of them have died on the
way here, and they're presumably coming

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:44.090
here because the Lothric bloodline is
obsessed with creating a worthy heir to

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:48.330
link the fire, and that's the event that
Londor want to influence.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:53.389
However, they're kind of out of luck,
because Lothric refused to link the

00:07:53.389 --> 00:07:55.279
fire and you,

00:07:55.279 --> 00:07:59.750
the unkindled who the linking of the
fire passed down to buy some twist of

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.610
fate met with Yoel,

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:04.699
a pilgrim who had all but given up

00:08:04.699 --> 00:08:06.510
"Ah,

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:09.330
you have attained ample strength.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:14.520
All will soon be clear, my good lord."

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:19.140
"Thanks to thee, Yoel's soul is redeemed.

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:24.260
Allow me to express my gratitude in his
stead."

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:28.040
When we meet with Yuria, she frequently mentions

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.660
she's keeping an eye on all those who could

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.940
potentially be a Lord of Hollows.

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:36.200
Orbeck
is one; Anri another, but she believes

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:41.010
that you are the true Lord of Hollows
and compels you to strike down Orbeck

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:43.950
before he becomes a threat, and to claim

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:49.480
Anri's Dark Sigils in this ritual,
within the Darkmoon Tomb. If you betray

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:53.720
Yuria, you don't do her quest in time, or you straight up attack her

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:56.970
then the Pale Shade of Londor will
hunt you down.

00:08:57.330 --> 00:09:01.830
But if you're allied with Yuria, then
the Pale Shade will assist you

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:03.120
throughout the world.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:07.230
Another thing to note is that many
characters associated with Londor use

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:11.910
bleed weapons, like Dark Drift, or the
Morian Blade, or the Mannequin Claws, and

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:18.330
blood loss is also a proven way to slow
the reanimation of the undying. So that

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:21.660
would be a pretty popular weapon in a
land full of hollows.

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:25.080
It's amazing, the level of depth in this
game when you look into it.

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:30.930
So let's talk about the undying. About
the undead curse, the Dark Sigils, and the

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:32.220
Dark Sign.

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:37.920
I've noticed a trend. When characters
talk about the Dark Sign, they often call

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:44.550
it a shackle. Something weighing men down.
"With dark unshackled, a curse will be

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:50.240
upon us." "- and cast off the shackles
placed upon your brethren." "- one who might

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:52.350
shatter the shackles of fate."

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:59.940
"Shackled by falsehoods, they yearn for love, unaware of it's grand illusion." The undead curse is

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:04.680
often referenced as appearing after
Gwyn linked the fire, so we assume that

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:07.020
Gwyn is at fault somehow.

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:12.520
It's the gods who shackled us. And while
we don't quite know how it started

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:17.910
we do know what happens to undead cursed with the Dark Sign. "For when the undead

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:18.840
dies

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:25.230
it is never truly dead, but only one step
closer to hollowing. Not all undead are

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:29.160
hollows, but all hollows were once undead."

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:34.200
You might be wondering, "What are Dark
Sigils?". Well I'm assuming that they're

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:39.060
synonymous with the Dark Sign. And the
description of the Dark Sigils says that

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:44.970
they're a problem because our humanity
literally leaks out of them, and the gap

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:49.680
that that creates is filled with the
accumulation of the undead curse.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:54.510
So our character is always in the
process of losing his Dark Soul, becoming

00:10:54.510 --> 00:11:00.570
more like the hollows that all humanoid
beings appear to have stemmed from. And

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:01.650
for ages

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:06.540
undead have been shepherded towards the first flame to fuel it, to link it, to sit

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:12.510
at it, and reset the world, and keep the
gods in their age of fire. But the world

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:15.480
was never meant to be stuck in this age
of fire.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:19.620
It was supposed to go; the age of
ancients, the age of fire, and then the

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:20.580
age of man.

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:26.040
Natural progression. But this age, this
age of fire, it struggles to die.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:29.490
Much in the same way that the undead
struggle to die.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:34.040
I mean you even see the Dark Sign in the sky towards the end of the game.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:42.350
That's pretty symbolic. "It is all a curse.
And it is your cursed flesh that will

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:49.399
inherit the flame." Undead are
literally burned as fuel for the

00:11:49.399 --> 00:11:55.550
bonfires that perpetuate this age. And I
had a realization, I finally understand

00:11:55.550 --> 00:12:00.949
that this is what we see in the opening
cutscene. We see the Soul of Cinder

00:12:00.949 --> 00:12:03.380
burning and undead to ash.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:08.839
assumedly to be buried in the Untended Graves. Which, remember, are not far at all

00:12:08.839 --> 00:12:15.920
from the kiln. And then we arise from
this undead ash as unkindled. Not just

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:22.370
undead, unkindled. In Miyazaki's words, unkindled are undead who failed to link

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:24.980
the fire, and were burnt to ash.

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:30.980
They exist to inherit the past, and put
an end to this cumulative tale.

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:35.060
So, the unkindled is special. We're not
just cinder,

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:39.589
we're not just the corpse of an undead,
we're both. We're something new. A new

00:12:39.589 --> 00:12:43.670
species for lack of a better word that,
has a choice.

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:47.540
The undead curse no longer has the power
over us that it once had.

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:52.910
We can choose to fuel the bonfires and
burn like charcoal, or we can choose to

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:55.430
embrace the undead curse itself.

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:59.959
Let's go back to Dark Souls 2, where it
actually foreshadows a lot of this

00:12:59.959 --> 00:13:00.889
happening.

00:13:00.889 --> 00:13:04.970
Vendrick, a past Lord
of Light, and a lord of mankind who

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:09.589
lost himself to the curse-.. I think he knew
that this was the way it would end, or at

00:13:09.589 --> 00:13:11.569
least he thought it would.

00:13:11.569 --> 00:13:13.880
"With fire they say

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:23.120
a true king can harness the curse. A lie, but I knew no better. Inherit fire and

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:25.070
harness the dark.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:31.790
Such is the calling of a true leader." We
are the unkindled who inherited fire.

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:34.790
We are the cursed undead who harnesses the dark.

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:38.510
We gain levels through the power of the Dark Sigil, and we even kill other

00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:42.380
powerful hollows and claim their
Sigils for our own, so that we can be

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:48.720
strong enough to claim the first flame
for mankind, and that is a new ending.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:50.900
"Our lord and leige,

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:55.120
thine heart is fixed upon
the linking of the fire.

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:59.380
But brave usurper, I prithee,

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:03.120
when the moment cometh to link
the fire,

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.820
wrest it from its mantle,

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:13.460
so that we hollows, in most honest shape of man,
may have it for our own."

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:17.620
You want to know what confused me most in Dark Souls 2?

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:21.800
I probably avoided talking about it
because it didn't make sense, and I

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:25.010
couldn't make an episode on something
that didn't really make much sense,

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:29.390
so the Prepare to Cry Episode 4 - Nashandra is missing because I could not

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:32.020
figure out her motives at the time,

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:36.220
but now I think I get it. So,
she was the fragment of the abyss that

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:39.600
usurped the Age of Fire from her Lord
of Light, Vendrick.

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:43.940
And after this Drangleic faded into dark, so you think

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:47.060
"Great, she won, she got exactly what she wanted right?

00:14:47.060 --> 00:14:51.200
The world has plummeted into dark, so surely she'd want to keep it that way, right?"

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:55.060
Wrong, because she calls us her Undead.

00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:59.840
She guides us, she tells us where to find Vendrick, she tells us where to find the

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:04.540
giants, she guides this bearer of the
curse all the way to the First Flame,

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.080
and we kill her.

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:09.080
That doesn't seem very smart but she
says,

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.020
And now I think I understand,

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:35.680
I think Nashandra needs an Undead. I think she
needed to wed Vendrick to claim the First Flame, but

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:38.540
he ran away to the crypt
where she couldn't follow him,

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:41.930
so she needed a replacement, the Bearer
of the Curse.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:44.240
I think that's why she led us here.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:45.900
"If you proceed,

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:51.120
Nashandra will come after you, knowing that you will take the throne and link the Fire.

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:55.560
She covets the First Flame, and the
Great Soul."

00:15:57.329 --> 00:16:03.540
In a similar manner, I think we wed Anri in this bizarre murder ritual and

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:08.540
can subsequently claim the first flame
like a Nashandra wanted to.

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:14.020
I always found it strange that a being
of Dark would want to claim the First Flame.

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:18.440
I had just thought they would want to stop
people linking it, and let it die but in

00:16:18.449 --> 00:16:22.889
Dark Souls 3 we learned that you can usurp it, and we learned that those of Londor

00:16:22.889 --> 00:16:28.379
are making a real push for that to
happen. So Dark Souls 2 aside, in the Lord

00:16:28.379 --> 00:16:32.999
of Hollows ending of Dark Souls 3 we
stifle the First Flame within our bodies

00:16:32.999 --> 00:16:35.759
and collapse. When we rise,

00:16:35.759 --> 00:16:39.089
reborn, you see this beautiful little
detail

00:16:39.089 --> 00:16:44.160
you see the Sun in the background is no
longer red like the Dark Sign. It's ringed

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:49.589
with white, and there's this illusion
where we lift this new Sun into the sky

00:16:49.589 --> 00:16:53.589
signaling and symbolizing a new age for
mankind

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:57.110
This video is crazy long, but the best is
yet to come

00:16:57.480 --> 00:17:01.860
There's two things i'm very excited
about seeing in the next DLC, and I do

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:05.159
think it's really likely that we'll get
Londor DLC.

00:17:05.159 --> 00:17:10.739
So one is that there's this boss in Dark
Souls one that was called Undead King Jar-Eel,

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:15.360
and he was cut from the New
Londo experience of Dark Souls one and I

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:19.139
have a lot of fond memories of
discovering Jar-Eel from another Dark

00:17:19.139 --> 00:17:23.519
Souls Youtuber, Hellkite Drake. He's really good
at digging in the game's files

00:17:23.519 --> 00:17:29.250
so since New Londo mirrors Londor, which
I guess is New New Londo I'm pretty

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:34.710
hyped to maybe fight Jar-Eel in the DLC, who knows. But the biggest curiosity, and you

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:39.600
see a clue in the thumbnail, is Velka the Goddess of Sin. Because i personally

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:44.909
think it's undeniable that Velka is
heavily involved in Londor, and

00:17:44.909 --> 00:17:50.820
Velka the Goddess of Sin is one of the
most influential and curiously, the most

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:56.159
absent characters of the Souls series. So Velka the Goddess of Sin is a rogue

00:17:56.159 --> 00:18:01.470
deity, but she is versed in arts both new
and old, and is considered to have a

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:04.750
great range of influence even as gods
