00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:32.230
these servants of Velka were called The Pardoners, men who listened to the

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:37.290
confessions of sinners, and the key words
being they offered salvation.

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:41.470
The Sable Church too, is also said to offer
salvation.

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:46.210
So I think if anyone is going to be the
mother to the three daughters of

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:50.830
The Sable Church, then I would put my
money on Velka. Hundred percent.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:56.760
Many spells like Vow of Silence are the spells and rights of Velka in Dark Souls one, and

00:18:56.770 --> 00:18:58.330
in Dark Souls 3

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:02.710
they're said to originate from Londor.
In Dark Souls one also with the Clutch

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:08.890
Rings, that were said to reach out to the
Crestfallen, and prevent despair. In

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:14.050
