to a dark deity and here, now, in Dark

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:19.570
Souls 3, those same rings are fabled in
Londor to prevent the despair of men.

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:21.100
Speaking of rings,

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:26.980
we get the Sacrifice rings from Yoel's
ashes, the hollow ashes. And the Sacrifice

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:31.750
rings also directly reference Velka.
I'm still going on with my list,

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:36.580
Velka also oversees the Darkmoon List of
the Guilty in Dark Souls 1 which was a

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:40.060
