in Dark Souls 3

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:46.090
this could explain why we sacrifice
Anri within the Darkmoon Tomb - she has a

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:51.160
relationship with the Darkmoons as well,
so it's crazy the amount of links there

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:53.320
